# Local scratch material — the user's own notes, deliberately git-ignored and
# never published.
#
# Why this file lives in docs/ instead of the package root: a root .npmignore
# does NOT override package.json's "files" field, but one in a subdirectory does.
# Without it, `files: ["docs"]` would publish these three files (npm pack reads
# the working tree, so .gitignore alone does not keep them out).
desktop-panel-kickoff-prompt.md
desktop-panel-prompt-short.md
optimization-plan.md
